### RESET
POST http://localhost:5005/api/admin/policy/reset

### BUY — SEED
POST http://localhost:5005/api/test/seed/buy
Content-Type: application/json

{ "Symbol":"TESTBUY", "Timeframe":"M5", "Count":30, "Start":1.1000, "Step":0.0003 }

### BUY — TRIGGER
POST http://localhost:5005/api/trade/evaluate
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Symbol":"TESTBUY","Timeframe":"M5",
  "Open":1.1060,"High":1.1070,"Low":1.1054,"Close":1.1068,
  "Atr":0.0012,"Bid":1.1066,"Ask":1.1068,"Equity":10000,"OpenTrades":0
}

